","meaning":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","explanation":"말：表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"11","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말이야","audio":"/audio/fd5a3f00cd7342725148.mp3"}},{"text":"한참을","meaning":"一阵，好一阵，好一会，老半天，大半天","explanation":"한참：一阵，好一阵，好一会，老半天，大半天；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"한참","audio":"/audio/7c9ab81e35e5793d4f35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72463","senseId":"1","lemma":"한참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한참을","audio":"/audio/6cd5b498744bcc06ea06.mp3"}},{"text":"기다려야","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기다려야","audio":"/audio/f9341d391242c88194da.mp3"}},{"text":"되겠는걸.","meaning":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","explanation":"되다：应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；는걸：表示新发现、感叹或与对方预期不同的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"18","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되겠는걸","audio":"/audio/36df8fdb2f7f6ba9ff99.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"87d7b69edce28452","term":"그러게","zh":"就是嘛，可不嘛","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3","entryId":"36269","definition":"用于赞成或同意对方所说的话。","pronunciation":["그러게"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"7c9ab81e35e5793d","term":"한참","zh":"一阵，好一阵，好一会，老半天，大半天","audio":"/audio/7c9ab81e35e5793d4f35.mp3","entryId":"72463","definition":"时间过了很久。","pronunciation":["한참"]},{"id":"1f9765247406d52d","term":"기다리다","zh":"等，等待","audio":"/